st_gms_user_deleted_item\nedit_gms_item_product_campaign\nget_gms_campaign_performance\nget_gms_item_performance\nPublic\nget_shops_by_partner\nget_merchants_by_partner\nget_access_token\nrefresh_access_token\nget_token_by_resend_code\nget_shopee_ip_ranges\nPush\nset_app_push_config\nget_app_push_config\nget_lost_push_message\nconfirm_consumed_lost_push_message\nSBS\nget_bound_whs_info\nget_current_inventory\nget_expiry_report\nget_stock_aging\nget_stock_movement\nget_fulfillment_mapping_inventory_list\nFBS\nquery_br_shop_enrollment_status\nquery_br_shop_invoice_error\nquery_br_shop_block_status\nquery_br_sku_block_status\nLivestream\nupload_image\ncreate_session\nupdate_session\nstart_session\nend_session\nget_session_detail\nadd_item_list\ndelete_item_list\nupdate_item_list\nget_item_count\nget_item_list\nupdate_show_item\ndelete_show_item\nget_show_item\nget_like_item_list\nget_recent_item_list\nget_item_set_list\nget_item_set_item_list\napply_item_set\nget_session_metric\nget_session_item_metric\nget_latest_comment_list\npost_comment\nban_user_comment\nunban_user_comment\nBrandPortal\nget_shop_sales_performance_detail\nget_principal_sales_performance_detail\nget_shop_affiliate_performance\nget_principal_affiliate_performance\nget_content_affiliate_performance\nget_shop_livestream_performance\nget_principal_livestream_performance\nget_session_livestream_performance\nget_shop_video_performance\nget_principal_video_performance\nget_clip_video_performance\nBuybox\nget_buybox_models_by_shop_id（only for BR now）\nget_buybox_models_by_model_id（only for BR now）\nget_buybox_shop_performance（only for BR now）\nget_buybox_model_performance（only for BR now）\nupdate_buybox_model_enrollment（only for BR now）\nBusinessInsights\nget_marketing_hot_listing（only BR now）\nv2.ams.get_open_campaign_added_product\nGET\n/api/v2/ams/get_open_campaign_added_product\nAPI Description\nCollapse\nRetrieve all products currently in the Open Campaign, including campaign status, commission rate, and promotion period\nRequest\nRequest Address\nMore\nCommon Request Parameters\nMore\nRequest Parameters\nCollapse\nName\n\t\nType\n\t\nRequired\n\t\nSample\n\t\nDescription\n\n\npage_size\n\t\nint32\n\t\nTrue\n\t\n20\n\t\n\nEach result set is returned as a page of entries. Use the \"page_size\" filters to control the maximum number of entries to retrieve per page (i.e., per call). This integer value is used to specify the maximum number of entries to return in a single \"page\" of data. The limit of page_size if between 1 and 100.\n\n\n\ncursor\n\t\nstring\n\t\nFalse\n\t\n1234,5678\n\t\n\nSpecifies the starting entry of data to return in the current call. Default is \"\" or not passed. If data is more than one page, the cursor can be some entry to start next call.\n\n\n\nsort_by\n\t\nstring\n\t\nFalse\n\t\ncommission_rate\n\t\n\nUse this field to specify which field to use to sort the returned item list. Sort by update_time and commission_id in descending order by default. Available values:\n\ncommission_rate: Sort by commission_rate in ascending order\n\n-commission_rate: Sort by commission_rate in descending order\n\n\n\nsearch_type\n\t\nstring\n\t\nFalse\n\t\nITEM_NAME\n\t\n\nSearch type: ITEM_NAME or ITEM_ID\n\n\n\nsearch_content\n\t\nstring\n\t\nFalse\n\t\ntest\n\t\n\nSearch for item_name or item_id, item_id should be split by comma and at most 50 items.\n\nRequest Example\nCollapse\nCopy\nJava\nPHP\ncURL\nPython\nUnirest.setTimeouts(0, 0);\nHttpResponse<String> response = Unirest.get(\"https://partner.shopeemobile.com/api/v2/ams/get_open_campaign_added_product?access_token=access_token&cursor=1234%2C5678&page_size=20&partner_id=partner_id&search_content=test&search_type=ITEM_NAME&shop_id=shop_id&sign=sign&sort_by=commission_rate&timestamp=timestamp\")\n.asString();\nResponse\nResponse Parameters\nCollapse\nName\n\t\nType\n\t\nSample\n\t\nDescription\n\n\nerror\n\t\nstring\n\t\nerror_business\n\t\n\nIndicate error type if hit error. Empty if no error happened.\n\n\n\nmessage\n\t\nstring\n\t\nPlease agree to the AMS T&C in Seller Center - Affiliate Marketing Solutions first before using Open API.\n\t\n\nIndicate error details if hit error. Empty if no error happened.\n\n\n\nrequest_id\n\t\nstring\n\t\nb937c04e554847789cbf3fe33a0ad5f1\n\t\n\nThe identifier for an API request for error tracking.\n\n\n\nresponse\n\t\nobject\n\t\n\t\n\n\nitem_list\n\t\nobject[]\n\t\n\t\n\n\nitem_id\n\t\nint64\n\t\n123\n\t\n\nItem ID\n\n\n\nitem_name\n\t\nstring\n\t\ntest\n\t\n\nItem Name\n\n\n\ncampaign_id\n\t\nint64\n\t\n123\n\t\n\nCampaign ID\n\n\n\ncampaign_status\n\t\nstring\n\t\nOngoing\n\t\n\nCampaign Status: \n\nUpcoming\n\nOngoing\n\nTerminating\n\n\n\ncommission_rate\n\t\nfloat\n\t\n1.11\n\t\n\nCommission Rate, 1.1 means 1.1%, support two decimal places\n\n\n\nperiod_start_time\n\t\ntimestamp\n\t\n1735660800\n\t\n\nPeriod Start Time\n\n\n\nperiod_end_time\n\t\ntimestamp\n\t\n1735660800\n\t\n\nPeriod End Time, if get 32503651199 (2999-12-31 23:59:59), it means no limit\n\n\n\npending_terminated_time\n\t\ntimestamp\n\t\n1735660800\n\t\n\nPending Terminated Time\n\n\n\ncommission_protection_list\n\t\nobject[]\n\t\n\t\n\nCommission Protection List\n\n\n\ncommission_rate\n\t\nfloat\n\t\n1.21\n\t\n\nCommission Rate, 1.1 means 1.1%, support two decimal places\n\n\n\nprotection_period_end_time\n\t\ntimestamp\n\t\n1735660800\n\t\n\nProtection Period End Time\n\n\n\nmax_commission_rate_current_day\n\t\nfloat\n\t\n1.21\n\t\n\nMax Commission Rate Current Day, 1.1 means 1.1%, support two decimal places\n\n\n\ntotal_count\n\t\nint32\n\t\n1000\n\t\n\nTotal number of items that match the condition\n\n\n\ncursor\n\t\nstring\n\t\n1234,5678\n\t\n\nPass the content in the next request as cursor to get the next page data\n\n\n\nhas_more\n\t\nboolean\n\t\ntrue\n\t\n\nThis is to indicate whether the item list is more than one page. If this value is true, you may want to continue to check next page to retrieve orders.\n\nResponse Example\nCollapse\nCopy\nJSON\n{\n\t\"error\": \"\",\n\t\"message\": \"\",\n\t\"request_id\": \"b937c04e554847789cbf3fe33a0ad5f1\",\n\t\"response\": {\n\t\t\"item_list\": [\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\"item_id\": 123,\n\t\t\t\t\"item_name\": \"test\",\n\t\t\t\t\"campaign_id\": 123,\n\t\t\t\t\"campaign_status\": \"Ongoing\",\n\t\t\t\t\"commission_rate\": 1.11,\n\t\t\t\t\"period_start_time\": 1735660800,\n\t\t\t\t\"period_end_time\": 1735660800,\n\t\t\t\t\"pending_terminated_time\": 1735660800,\n\t\t\t\t\"commission_protection_list\": [\n\t\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"commission_rate\": 1.21,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\"protection_period_end_time\": 1735660800\n\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t],\n\t\t\t\t\"max_commission_rate_current_day\": 1.21\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t],\n\t\t\"total_count\": 1000,\n\t\t\"cursor\": \"1234,5678\",\n\t\t\"has_more\": true\n\t}\n}\nError Codes\nCollapse\nBusiness Error Codes\nError\n\t\nError Description\n\t\nDetails and Guidance\n\n\nerror_server\n\t\nSomething wrong. Please try later.\n\t\n\n\nerror_param\n\t\nInvalid cursor. The cursor of first page is not passed or blank string, and subsequent pages are passed to the cursor in the response.\n\t\n\n\nerror_param\n\t\nitem_id_list is blank or exceeded max limit.\n\t\n\n\nerror_param\n\t\ninvalid limit\n\t\n\n\nerror_param\n\t\ninvalid page_size\n\t\n\n\nerror_param\n\t\ninvalid param\n\t\n\n\nerror_param\n\t\ninvalid search_content\n\t\n\n\nerror_param\n\t\ninvalid search_type\n\t\n\n\nerror_param\n\t\ninvalid sort_by type\n\t\n\n\nerror_server\n\t\nSomething wrong. Please try later.\n\t\n\n\nerror_business\n\t\nSorry you don't have access to AMS features.\n\t\n\n\nerror_business\n\t\nPlease agree to the AMS T&C in Seller Center - Affiliate Marketing Solutions first before using Open API.\n\t\n\n\nerror_business\n\t\nThe seller commission operation is frozen.\n\t\nCommon Error Codes\nError Example\nCollapse\nCopy\nJSON\n{\n\t\"error\": \"error_business\",\n\t\"message\": \"Please agree to the AMS T&C in Seller Center - Affiliate Marketing Solutions first before using Open API.\",\n\t\"request_id\": \"b937c04e554847789cbf3fe33a0ad5f1\"\n}\n\nAPI Permissions\nCollapse\nAPP types that can call this API.\nAffiliate Marketing Solution Management\nAPI Tools\nCollapse\nAPI Test Tools\nAPI Access Log\nUpdate Log\nCollapse\nDate\n\t\nUpdate Details\n\n\n2025-10-15\n\t\nNew API\nUser Guide\nDeveloper Guide\nAPI reference\nPush Mechanism\nShopee Open Platform Data Protection Policy\nShopee Markets\nService Market\nSeller Education Hub (Singapore)\nSeller Education Hub (Malaysia)\nSeller Education Hub (Thailand)\nSeller Education Hub (Vietnam)\nSeller Education Hub (Indonesia)\nSeller Education Hub (Philippines)\nSeller Education Hub (Brazil)\nSeller Education Hub (Japan)\nSeller Education Hub (Korea)\nSeller Education Hub (Hongkong)\n虾皮卖家学习中心\nSupport\nAnnouncement\nFAQ\nRaise Ticket\nCopyright @ Shopee 2025"
